 "remarks": "Exceptional investment opportunity in a convenient Stamford location! This fully leased three-family property features three spacious 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartments, including a beautifully renovated top-floor residence. The first and second-floor units offer nearly identical, functional layouts with generously sized bedrooms, inviting living rooms, large eat-in kitchens, ample closet space, and abundant natural light. The third-floor apartment has been completely renovated, featuring new flooring, fresh paint, modern finishes, an updated kitchen with white cabinetry and new appliances, and a beautifully remodeled bathroom. Each apartment also includes an enclosed porch, providing additional versatile living space. Ample off-street parking adds everyday convenience. Ideally located just minutes from the Stamford Metro-North train station and I-95, offering easy access to NYC. Enjoy a short drive to Downtown Stamford's vibrant dining, shopping, nightlife, and entertainment. Nearby Shippan amenities include West Beach, Cummings Park, walking paths, recreational facilities, and the scenic Long Island Sound shoreline. An outstanding opportunity to acquire a fully occupied, income-producing property in Stamford's highly desirable rental market with strong long-term investment potential!",
